                                "sense_id": "5450b7b9-3146-3318-9172-a2a2a123660a",
                                "text": "We would get fresh fish every Friday, carp and pike, which my mother would grind to make the gefilte fish for shabbas. One Friday I added a little trimethylamine to the fish, and when my mother smelled this, she grimaced and threw the lot away."
